================================================================================
Public data sources fetched at run time
================================================================================

WORLD NOW retrieves live public data from the sources below. Nothing is
redistributed with this repository; each response is fetched by the person
running the software, and the attribution required by each source is shown in
the application beside the data it produced.

- USGS Earthquake Hazards Program (courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey)
  US Government work, public domain.

- NASA EONET
  US Government work, public domain.

- GDACS (UN OCHA / EC JRC)
  Free reuse with attribution.

- GDELT Project
  Citation and a link to https://www.gdeltproject.org/ are mandatory.

- NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center (SWPC)
  US Government work, public domain.

- National Weather Service (NWS)
  US Government work, public domain.

- adsb.lol contributors (ODbL 1.0)
  Open Database License; attribution is required and share-alike applies to
  derived databases. Aircraft positions are held in memory only.

Sources that are not enabled by default — including those requiring a user's
own key, and those whose terms have not been verified — are refused at run
time and make no network request. Their state and the reason are visible in
the application's coverage view.

